# 2026-09-20 (SENTRIQ session R) — ONE OWNER PER FILE.
# The SENTRIQ engine lives in the NESTED repo openbb_platform/ (remote: quantedge-platform).
# This outer fork also tracked 181 stale copies of the same files: on 2026-09-20 its committed
# setup_scanner.py was 85 lines behind the working tree and setup_ledger.py 200 lines behind, so a
# `git checkout`/`git restore`/`git stash pop` HERE would have silently reverted live engine logic
# by a month, with no engine-fingerprint change until the next scan. Untracked here; the nested
# repo remains the sole owner. Do not re-add these paths to this repository.
